5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should be careful about external dependencies. I want to see the winter road closures north of the river and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about who can actually get to us! I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I suspect our funding structure is the real issue. I will check the county grant terms and the endowment, and running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We always ignore the past. I'm looking into the two programmes begun six years ago and evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to know if we have the right people. I'll check the volunteer register and supervision training and neighbourhood associations and tool certification.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
