55,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Candidate A uses partner organizations and facilitators. This avoids the contractor delays of B and the road risks of D. It's the most stable.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Candidate D is my dream for the outer wards, but A also reaches across the district. If it's in the community, the bus issue is solved!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,George,,"A uses contracted session fees. If the grant covers the first year, we need to be sure the flat budget can handle it. But it's better than a vehicle.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,A is exactly like the partner-run groups that survived six years ago. B is just the digitisation failure all over again. I'm voting A.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Candidate C requires tool certification, which we lost. A uses outside facilitators, so our staff doesn't need the specialized technical skills. I like A.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. A is the most rational choice given the risks of infrastructure and external suppliers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm torn, but if A can be placed in those outer wards where the bus links are gone, it's a wonderful way to help people.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,George,,It's a sustainable choice. It doesn't require the heavy running costs that a mobile unit would demand from our thin budget.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,It's the only one backed by a proven track record in this system. Let's not be foolish and try B or C.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I feel much more comfortable with A. It doesn't force the staff to do things they aren't trained for.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,It seems we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm happy as long as the people in the outer wards are included!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,George,,I can support this.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,"Finally, we're using our heads.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
